The perspective taxonomy is the redeeming quality—it is a real conceptual contribution and shows genuine domain-aware thinking. But the fundamental misattribution of quantitative results, the trivial baselines, and the text-table contradiction are severe enough to override strengths for a lower-half paper. This maps to approximately **2.0**, calibrated between TabPalooza (1.2) and DualRes (2.5).

